<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Self-Directed Search System Password Reset</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #eef3f8; color: #111827; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
    .wrapper { width: 100%; padding: 28px 12px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d8e1ea; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .topbar { height: 6px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2d8bc4 0 42%, #ffeb3b 42% 50%, #f44336 50% 58%, #ffeb3b 58% 66%, #2d8bc4 66% 100%); }
    .header { padding: 24px 28px 18px; background: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7; }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2d8bc4; }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; color: #07183d; }
    .content { padding: 26px 28px 24px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; margin: 14px 0 8px; padding: 11px 18px; border-radius: 8px; background: #2d8bc4; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
    .link { word-break: break-all; font-size: 13px; color: #2d8bc4; }
    .security { margin-top: 18px; padding: 14px 16px; border-left: 4px solid #ffeb3b; background: #fffbeb; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #374151; }
    .footer { padding: 18px 28px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="topbar"></div>
      <div class="header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Account recovery</p>
        <h1>Self-Directed Search System</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
        <p>We received a request to reset the password for your Self-Directed Search System account.</p>
        <p>Use the secure link below to set a new password:</p>
        <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="button">Reset password</a>
        <p class="link">{{resetUrl}}</p>
        <div class="security">
          This link expires for security. If you did not request a password reset, ignore this email.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <strong>Self-Directed Search System</strong><br>
        Ministry of Labour and Social Security - Kingdom of Eswatini<br>
        Powered by Datamatics Eswatini
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
